# F3 run artifacts are generated per release and bind a git commit that cannot
# be the commit they are stored in, so they are never tracked. Completed human
# evidence is the exception: the adjudication ledger and the four G1 test
# reports stay tracked as release evidence.
eval/continuation-acceptance-1a3b/run/*
